{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"MatchRouteOptions"},{"type":"text","value":" type is used to describe the options that can be used when matching a route."}]},{"type":"code","value":"interface MatchRouteOptions {\n  pending?: boolean\n  caseSensitive?: boolean /* @deprecated */\n  includeSearch?: boolean\n  fuzzy?: boolean\n}","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"matchrouteoptions-properties","children":[{"type":"text","value":"MatchRouteOptions properties"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"MatchRouteOptions"},{"type":"text","value":" type has the following properties:"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"pending-property","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"pending"},{"type":"text","value":" property"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"true"},{"type":"text","value":", will match against pending location instead of the current location"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"casesensitive-property-deprecated","children":[{"type":"strike","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"caseSensitive"}]},{"type":"text","value":" property (deprecated)"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"true"},{"type":"text","value":", will match against the current location with case sensitivity"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Declare case sensitivity in the route definition instead, or globally for all routes using the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"caseSensitive"},{"type":"text","value":" option on the router"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"includesearch-property","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"includeSearch"},{"type":"text","value":" property"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"true"},{"type":"text","value":", will match against the current location's search params using a deep inclusive check. e.g. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"{ a: 1 }"},{"type":"text","value":" will match for a current location of "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"{ a: 1, b: 2 }"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"fuzzy-property","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"fuzzy"},{"type":"text","value":" property"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"true"},{"type":"text","value":", will match against the current location using a fuzzy match. e.g. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"/posts"},{"type":"text","value":" will match for a current location of "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"/posts/123"}]}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"matchrouteoptions-properties","text":"MatchRouteOptions properties","level":2},{"id":"pending-property","text":"pending property","level":3},{"id":"casesensitive-property-deprecated","text":"caseSensitive property (deprecated)","level":3},{"id":"includesearch-property","text":"includeSearch property","level":3},{"id":"fuzzy-property","text":"fuzzy property","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThe `MatchRouteOptions` type is used to describe the options that can be used when matching a route.\n\n```tsx\ninterface MatchRouteOptions {\n  pending?: boolean\n  caseSensitive?: boolean /* @deprecated */\n  includeSearch?: boolean\n  fuzzy?: boolean\n}\n```\n\n## MatchRouteOptions properties\n\nThe `MatchRouteOptions` type has the following properties:\n\n### `pending` property\n\n- Type: `boolean`\n- Optional\n- If `true`, will match against pending location instead of the current location\n\n### ~~`caseSensitive`~~ property (deprecated)\n\n- Type: `boolean`\n- Optional\n- If `true`, will match against the current location with case sensitivity\n- Declare case sensitivity in the route definition instead, or globally for all routes using the `caseSensitive` option on the router\n\n### `includeSearch` property\n\n- Type: `boolean`\n- Optional\n- If `true`, will match against the current location's search params using a deep inclusive check. e.g. `{ a: 1 }` will match for a current location of `{ a: 1, b: 2 }`\n\n### `fuzzy` property\n\n- Type: `boolean`\n- Optional\n- If `true`, will match against the current location using a fuzzy match. e.g. `/posts` will match for a current location of `/posts/123`\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: MatchRouteOptionsType\ntitle: MatchRouteOptions type\n---\n\nThe `MatchRouteOptions` type is used to describe the options that can be used when matching a route.\n\n```tsx\ninterface MatchRouteOptions {\n  pending?: boolean\n  caseSensitive?: boolean /* @deprecated */\n  includeSearch?: boolean\n  fuzzy?: boolean\n}\n```\n\n## MatchRouteOptions properties\n\nThe `MatchRouteOptions` type has the following properties:\n\n### `pending` property\n\n- Type: `boolean`\n- Optional\n- If `true`, will match against pending location instead of the current location\n\n### ~~`caseSensitive`~~ property (deprecated)\n\n- Type: `boolean`\n- Optional\n- If `true`, will match against the current location with case sensitivity\n- Declare case sensitivity in the route definition instead, or globally for all routes using the `caseSensitive` option on the router\n\n### `includeSearch` property\n\n- Type: `boolean`\n- Optional\n- If `true`, will match against the current location's search params using a deep inclusive check. e.g. `{ a: 1 }` will match for a current location of `{ a: 1, b: 2 }`\n\n### `fuzzy` property\n\n- Type: `boolean`\n- Optional\n- If `true`, will match against the current location using a fuzzy match. e.g. `/posts` will match for a current location of `/posts/123`\n"}
